{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0f60ba00-bf97-8209-acb4-43d0e599e6e9",
  "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:57:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:54:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities Department, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Mike Cullen. I am calling about a water and sewer bill. It is double what I normally pay, and I cannot explain this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:54:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let's take a look. Do you have the bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:55:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have the paper bill in my hand. It is dated November twenty-fourth. The amount is almost exactly two times the previous one. I am a landlord, the building is the same, the number of tenants is the same. Nothing changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. A jump like that usually comes from either a higher meter reading or an estimated read that got corrected. Is there a reading listed on the bill, current and previous?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:55:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a current reading and a previous reading. The difference is large. But I do not believe we used this much water. This is not reasonable to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Since you're not seeing a reason, the next step would be a meter re-read, and someone can also check for a leak on the property side. I can put in that request for you. Would you give me the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:55:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would prefer to give it to the person who will do the re-read. Please write the request under my name and this phone number, four zero one, five five five, zero one nine eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:56:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I have the name and that number. I'll note the request and the billing office will follow up on the address with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:56:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Another question. If I decide to pay while this is reviewed, can the website take a card payment right now? It is almost three in the afternoon. Or does it work only in office hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:56:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The online payment page is available around the clock, so you can pay by card tonight or over the weekend. It'll post when the office processes it, usually the next business day. There's also a drop box at City Hall for checks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:56:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That is a clear answer. I will do it online this evening, because I am busy. My daughter has a recorder concert next week and I must help her prepare."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds nice. And with the storm moving in today, staying home tonight is probably smart anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Then I will wait for the call about the meter. I expect it will be soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:56:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The billing office should reach out early next week. If you pay in the meantime, keep your confirmation in case it gets adjusted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:57:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will keep it. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T14:57:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cullen. Stay safe out there."
    }
  ],
